# First compile errors on Android (apply after 03).
#
# CI run 5 compiled all 44,510 object files the APK needs except 13. Each fix
# below addresses one of them: desktop-only declarations used by shared code,
# Android callers of Safe Browsing and RLZ code that Helium compiles out, and
# two call sites that missed a new function parameter.
# Applies to Chromium 155.0.8059.39 with Helium 0.19.2.1; verified by CI.
--- a/chrome/browser/android/locale/locale_template_url_loader.cc
